{"4100520": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "BABEL", "steam_appid": 4100520, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hello There!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > I hope the Demo will be available before autumn. There are many bugs, also design issues right now, but i hope i can show you more and more things about the game, before demo release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you interested in the developement and how the project actually going on, check out my <strong>instagram</strong> and <strong>tiktok.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >(links attached to the page)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Babel</strong> brings life to the iconic works of Hieronymus Bosch, Pieter Bruegel, Arcimboldo, and other visionary masters in  anachronic &amp; postmodern scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Find</strong> your way through a meta-apocalyptic <strong>Tower of Babel </strong>built up to space where the <strong>Human Race exiled by God </strong>and the creatures of <strong>Hell</strong> has overrun the colossal structure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4100520/extras/b0ecb75e1160ce2a3e6f9032c9df1a08.avif?t=1780563243\" width=1055 height=259 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world is mainly building up from paintings of <strong>Hieronymush Bosch</strong>, enviroment pieces and charachters, what take place in the levels of <strong>Bruegel's Tower of Babel</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Tower preferably going to have <strong>9 levels:</strong>  3 bottom for the <strong>Hellscape</strong>, 3 center for the <strong>Earthly Delights</strong>, 3 for the <strong>Garden 